rekta-shell — provenance notice

1. Rekta Design
   rekta-shell implements Rekta Design. Its design tokens and icons are
   generated at build time from a pinned commit of the Rekta Design
   repository; no Rekta Design files are copied into this repository.

   Rekta Design: https://github.com/DerDaehne/rekta-design
   Licence: MIT (code, tokens) and CC BY 4.0 (documentation)

2. Typeface
